#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/advanced.rst:2
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Advanced"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/advanced.rst:4
msgid ""
"There are several advanced features provided within |morpheus| that can "
"leverage some cool aspects of VMware. One of these features is Remote "
"Console support directly to the hypervisor. To enable this feature a few "
"prerequisites must be met. First, the |morpheus| appliance must have network"
" access to the ESXi hosts within VCenter. Secondly, firewall settings need "
"to be adjusted on each ESXi host. This can be done in VSphere under firewall"
" configuration on the host. Simply check the `gdbserver` option, which will "
"open up the necessary ports (starting at 5900 range)."
msgstr ""
"There son several advanced características provided dentro de |morpheus| que"
" puede leverage algunos cool aspects of VMware. One of estos características"
" es Remote Console support directly to el hypervisor. To enable este "
"característica un few prerequisites debe be met. First, el |morpheus| "
"appliance debe tienen network acceso to el ESXi hosts dentro de VCenter. "
"Secondly, firewall configuración need to be adjusted on cada ESXi host. This"
" puede be done in VSphere under firewall configuración on el host. Simply "
"check el `gdbserver` opción, cual será open up el necesario ports (starting "
"at 5900 range)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/advanced.rst:6
msgid "Hypervisor Console for vCenter 6.5 requires |morpheus| v3.2.0+"
msgstr "Hypervisor Console para vCenter 6.5 requires |morpheus| v3.2.0+"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/advanced.rst:8
msgid ""
"Now that the ESXi hosts are ready to utilize remote console, simply edit the"
" cloud in |morpheus| via ``Infrastructure > Clouds``. Check the option that "
"says `Enable Hypervisor Console`. It is important to note that currently "
"this functionality only works for newly provisioned vm's provisioned "
"directly via |morpheus|. This should change soon however."
msgstr ""
"Now que el ESXi hosts son ready to utilize remoto console, simply edit la "
"nube in |morpheus| via ``Infrastructure > Clouds``. Marque la opción que "
"says `Enable Hypervisor Console`. It es importante to tenga en cuenta que "
"actualmente este functionality solo works para newly provisioned vm's "
"provisioned directly via |morpheus|. This debería cambio soon sin embargo."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/advanced.rst:10
msgid ""
"It is also possible to import vm snapshots for backup or conversion purposes"
" from VCenter and also an ESXi host. However, this does require that the "
"ESXi host license has an enterprise level license as it will not allow the "
"appliance to download a virtual image if it is not a paid VMware license."
msgstr ""
"It es también possible to import vm snapshots para backup o conversion "
"purposes desde VCenter y también un ESXi host. Sin embargo, este does "
"require que el ESXi host license tiene un enterprise level license as it no "
"allow el appliance to download un virtual image if it no es un paid VMware "
"license."
